  "answer": "Based on the research, here is the breakdown of the information:\n\n1.  **Team holding the record:** The team that holds the record for the most consecutive women's football national top division league titles is **SFK 2000 Sarajevo** (24 consecutive titles), according to Guinness World Records (E3).\n2.  **Chairman:** The current chairman of SFK 2000 Sarajevo is **Samira Hurem** (E4).\n3.  **Birth City:** Samira Hurem's birth city is **Sarajevo** (E6).\n4.  **Current Mayor:** The incumbent mayor of Sarajevo is **Samir Avdić** (E8).\n\n***\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\nThe current mayor of the birth city (Sarajevo) of the current chairman of SFK 2000 Sarajevo (Samira Hurem) is **Samir Avdić**.\n\n*Note: The evidence indicates that Samir Avdić has been in office since July 16, 2025, which is after the requested date of April 2025, but he is listed as the incumbent mayor (E8).*\n\n### Sources\n*   **SFK 2000 Sarajevo Record:** https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/382948-most-consecutive-football-soccer-national-top-division-league-titles-female (E3)\n*   **Chairman (Samira Hurem):** https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SFK_2000 (E4)\n*   **Birth City (Sarajevo):** https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samira_Hurem (E6)\n*   **Mayor (Samir Avdić):** https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_mayors_of_Sarajevo (E8)",
